{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block body %}<p class="eyebrow">PREFERENCES</p><h1>Settings</h1><section class="panel"><h2>Foundation phase</h2><dl><dt>Network access</dt><dd>Localhost only. LAN deployment is planned for the release phase.</dd><dt>Host playback and folder actions</dt><dd>Disabled. These controls will be added in a later phase.</dd><dt>Metadata provider</dt><dd>TMDB integration is planned. No credential is needed yet.</dd><dt>Background jobs</dt><dd>Durable queues are ready. Discovery and availability handlers arrive in later phases. Saving a location does not queue a scan.</dd></dl></section><section class="panel"><h2>Background workers</h2>{% for worker in workers %}<h3>{{ worker.name|capitalize }}</h3><p>{{ worker.status }} · Last heartbeat (UTC): {{ worker.heartbeat }}</p>{% if worker.error %}<p class="notice error">{{ worker.error }}</p>{% endif %}{% endfor %}<p class="muted">If a worker stops, restart using the production start script. Development launchers only start HTTP. Worker logs are in the application data directory under logs/.</p></section>{% endblock %}
